flowchart LR
  SRC[Raw Water Source] --> XV[Inlet Isolation / Control Valve]
  XV --> TK[TK-101 Raw Water Tank]
  TK --> STR[Suction Strainer, if fitted]
  STR --> P101[P-101 Transfer Pump]
  P101 --> HDR[RO Feed Header]
  HDR --> P201[P-201 RO Feed Pump]
  P201 --> SF[Self-Cleaning Filter]
  SF --> CF[Cartridge Filter]
  CF --> CD[Chemical Dosing, exact point to confirm]
  CD --> P202[P-202 High-Pressure Pump]
  P202 --> RO[RO Membrane Train]
  RO -->|Permeate| PTK[TK-201 Permeate Tank]
  RO -->|Reject / Concentrate| RJ[Reject Handling]
